=== StockScans-inspired round (live in production 2026-10-19) ===
Migrations 0022 to 0032 are applied on Neon, and the code is deployed from master.
Features and where to find them:
1. Results calendar and quarterly results at /valuation/results, with a "Load missing financials" button.
2. Announcements feed with tags, "only important" push setting and filings per company at /valuation/announcements and /valuation/filings/[symbol].
3. Insider trades and SAST filings at /valuation/insider-trades.
4. Corporate actions and ex-dates at /valuation/corporate-actions.
5. Bulk and block deals alerts and shareholding view for tracked companies at /valuation/tracking.
6. Optional Telegram backup alerts, linked from /valuation/settings.
7. Preset scans, Scan Match badges and the List/Grid chart view on /valuation/stage-scanner.
8. Earnings trend table on the sector basket pages.
9. Named watchlist lists and sections at /valuation/lists.
10. Price and holding alert rules at /valuation/price-alerts.
11. Saved scans with daily new-match alerts and shareable links at /valuation/scans and /valuation/scans/shared/[id].
12. Returns comparison at /valuation/returns.
13. Market breadth at /valuation/breadth.
14. Concall analysis, guidance credibility and result quality at /valuation/concalls and /valuation/concalls/[symbol], plus the panel on each company page.
15. Red flag checks at /valuation/red-flags.
Also on the company page: filings panel, reverse DCF and segment financials.
Scanner fixes: weekend-dated price candles are ignored when appending, and 5-year-high and fundamental presets use stored data.
Concall guidance now understands margin change targets (for example "EBITDA margin expansion of 3-4%") and judges them against the change in actuals.
Limits and things to do:
